e_term":"故楚莊王苗裔也","person_ids":["b1y_l5y_xmz","q8m_d0c_kq3"],"status":"reported_not_collated","adopted":false,"received_reading":"苗裔","reported_reading":"楚莊王弟","component":"reported_kinship","quote":"楚莊王弟為盜者","raw_quote":"(汶江郡本冉/駹音亾江反)白馬最大(按夷邑名/即白馬氐)莊蹻(音炬灼反楚莊/王弟為盜者)¶","quote_normalization":"僅抽取注中原詞，去原數位雙行斜線與段末符，不改字。","commentator":"司馬貞《史記索隱》","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0003/blob/85cc2d3b1952d7a66280628c8d2141d4f1593fc7/KR2a0003_025.txt#L191","image_verified":false,"reported_relationship":{"predicate":"brother","subject_person_id":"b1y_l5y_xmz","object_person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","object_generation_relative_to_subject":0,"older_person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","younger_person_id":"b1y_l5y_xmz","status":"commentary_claim_not_adopted"},"interpretation_note":"古注把莊蹻說成楚莊王弟為盜者，與正文苗裔及楚威王時敘事不合。分層保存，不據此新增同輩父系、改寫苗裔或與其他同名莊蹻強接；報告未採納關係供機讀，非已採用家族邊。"}],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji116-001","subject_person_id":"b1y_l5y_xmz","predicate":"ancestor","object_person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi","source_id":"s-shiji116-xinanyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p002","quote":"始楚威王時，使將軍莊蹻將兵循江上，略巴、黔中以西。莊蹻者，故楚莊王苗裔也。蹻至滇池，地方三百里，旁平地，肥饒數千里，以兵威定屬楚。欲歸報，會秦擊奪楚巴、黔中郡，道塞不通，因還，以其眾王滇，變服，從其俗，以長之。秦時常頞略通五尺道，諸此國頗置吏焉。十餘歲，秦滅。及漢興，皆棄此國而開蜀故徼。巴蜀民或竊出商賈，取其筰馬、僰僮、髦牛，以此巴蜀殷富。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"故楚莊王苗裔也"},"interpretation_note":"苗裔為遠祖陳述，世代未知，不作直接父親或預接整條父系。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m002-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"莊蹻","kind":"person","person_id":"b1y_l5y_xmz","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m002-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"莊蹻","kind":"person","person_id":"b1y_l5y_xmz","stat